        },
        {
          "text": "“He’ll tell you no.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 12834
        },
        {
          "text": "“His truck is older than me. I’m serious. It makes this horrible sound every time he starts it, but he keeps saying it’s",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 12943
        },
        {
          "text": "“When I make enough, I’m buying him a new truck.” Carson looked directly into the camera. “He can complain all he wants.",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 13141
        }
