    },
    {
      "block": "原句8",
      "no": 8,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "The next video was dated five years ago. I almost didn’t click it. Carson was twenty. Maybe twenty-one. The arena was la",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 13879
        },
        {
          "text": "Carson looked directly toward the camera. “Try keeping me away.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 14837
        },
        {
          "text": "The video ended. There wasn’t another race after it. I scrolled hoping to see more, but there was nothing. That had been",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 14900
        },
        {
          "text": "Exactly when the accident happened",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 15034
        }
